WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.848
CVA6 is a configurable RISC-V processor code base, not one fixed chip.

2
00:00:04.848 --> 00:00:09.972
Its family includes both embedded and application-oriented configurations.

3
00:00:09.972 --> 00:00:19.114
To evaluate it, separate three questions: what the core does, which configuration you selected, and what surrounds it in the system.

4
00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:27.909
We will compare actual parameter files, follow the main data path, and identify where platform software and verification enter.

5
00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:33.380
You can then choose a useful next source without reading the entire repository.

